---
// How FastAPI routes an endpoint by its declaration. 40 threads = the
// default read off /threadpool-limit in the capture beside the figure.
const W = 900, H = 330;
---
<figure class="bep6h">
  <div class="bep6h-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two rows. async def runs directly on the event loop, one thread: safe only if the body awaits. Plain def is handed to a pool of 40 threads: a blocking call there blocks only a pool thread.">
    <text x="40" y="36" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>you write</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bạn viết</tspan></text>
    <text x="330" y="36" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>FastAPI runs it on</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>FastAPI chạy nó trên</tspan></text>
    <text x="640" y="36" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>so a blocking call</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nên một lời gọi chặn</tspan></text>

    <rect x="40" y="62" width="220" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="150" y="101" text-anchor="middle" class="code">async def</text>
    <polygon points="268,94 318,94 318,88 330,94 318,100 318,94" class="arrow" />
    <rect x="340" y="62" width="250" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="465" y="90" text-anchor="middle" class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>the event loop</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>event loop</tspan></text>
    <text x="465" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>one thread, shared by all</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một thread, dùng chung cho tất cả</tspan></text>
    <polygon points="598,94 628,94 628,88 640,94 628,100 628,94" class="arrowr" />
    <text x="650" y="90" class="vr"><tspan data-lang-en>freezes every other</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>làm đứng mọi request</tspan></text>
    <text x="650" y="110" class="vr"><tspan data-lang-en>request</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khác</tspan></text>

    <rect x="40" y="170" width="220" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="150" y="209" text-anchor="middle" class="code">def</text>
    <polygon points="268,202 318,202 318,196 330,202 318,208 318,202" class="arrow" />
    <rect x="340" y="170" width="250" height="64" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="465" y="198" text-anchor="middle" class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>a thread pool</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>pool thread</tspan></text>
    <text x="465" y="218" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>40 threads by default</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mặc định 40 thread</tspan></text>
    <polygon points="598,202 628,202 628,196 640,202 628,208 628,202" class="arrow" />
    <text x="650" y="198" class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>blocks only one</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chỉ chặn một</tspan></text>
    <text x="650" y="218" class="v"><tspan data-lang-en>pool thread</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thread của pool</tspan></text>

    <text x="40" y="288" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>The loop is only safe when the body awaits whatever it waits on.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Loop chỉ an toàn khi thân hàm await mọi thứ nó chờ.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>FastAPI picks the tool from how you declare the endpoint, not from what the body does.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>FastAPI chọn công cụ theo cách bạn khai báo endpoint, không theo việc thân hàm làm.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep6h { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep6h-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep6h svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep6h text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep6h .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep6h .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep6h .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep6h .v { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep6h .vr { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep6h .tk { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .bep6h .axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep6h .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .bep6h .ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6h .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6h .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .bep6h .arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep6h .arrowr { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep6h .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep6h .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep6h figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
